<section id="associations" class="associations-section">
    <h1>Professional Associations</h1>
    <p>Here are some of the organizations I’m involved in. Each one reflects my commitment to service, growth, and
        community.</p>

    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Air National Guard</strong><br />
            As a Cyber Defense Operator in the Air National Guard, I support mission-critical communications and
            cybersecurity efforts that protect national interests both at home and abroad.<br />
            <a href="https://www.ang.af.mil/" target="_blank">
                <button>Visit Air National Guard</button>
            </a>
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>Junior Enlisted Council for Airmen</strong><br />
            I’m part of a leadership-focused group within the military that empowers junior enlisted Airmen to engage in
            mentorship, volunteer service, and professional development. This is an internal organization within the Air
            National Guard and does not have a public website.
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>American Foundation for Suicide Prevention (AFSP)</strong><br />
            I actively volunteer with AFSP to raise awareness, support survivors of suicide loss, and promote mental
            health advocacy through community events like Out of the Darkness walks.<br />
            <a href="https://afsp.org/" target="_blank">
                <button>Visit AFSP</button>
            </a>
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)</strong><br />
            I stay connected with the latest advancements in computing, cybersecurity, and emerging technologies while
            being part of a global professional community.<br />
            <a href="https://www.ieee.org/" target="_blank">
                <button>Visit IEEE</button>
            </a>
        </li>
    </ul>
</section>